<!--
  Njia sitemap.

  One entry, deliberately. Njia is a single-page app: Discover, Design,
  Decide, Connect, Track and Help are rendered client-side by navigateTo()
  and never become distinct server URLs. The app does accept a hash on entry
  (e.g. /#decide), but search engines collapse fragments to the page they
  hang off, so listing them here would claim URLs that do not independently
  exist. Better one honest entry than seven invented ones.

  lastmod is maintained by hand — there is no build step to generate it. It
  marks the last substantive content change, not every deploy.
-->
